  <body>
    <div>
      <p begin="00:15.564" end="00:18.605" ttm:agent="v1">Look, um, do you lo-lo-lo-love me?</p>
      <p begin="00:18.605" end="00:20.376" ttm:agent="v1">I just gotta know</p>
      <p begin="00:20.376" end="00:21.876" ttm:agent="v1">'Cause you said it ain't shit</p>
      <p begin="00:21.392" end="00:22.892" ttm:agent="v1">But shit can get ugly</p>
      <p begin="00:22.588" end="00:24.088" ttm:agent="v1"/>
      <p begin="00:23.052" end="00:24.552" ttm:agent="v1">Like you plus me</p>
      <p begin="00:24.041" end="00:25.541" ttm:agent="v1">Me plus you</p>
      <p begin="00:24.989" end="00:26.489" ttm:agent="v1">Do you know what I mean?</p>
      <p begin="00:26.022" end="00:27.522" ttm:agent="v1">And even if it don't add up</p>
      <p begin="00:27.152" end="00:28.652" ttm:agent="v1">I can minus the hoes</p>
      <p begin="00:28.207" end="00:29.707" ttm:agent="v1">And we'll see where it leads</p>
      <p begin="00:29.284" end="00:30.784" ttm:agent="v1"/>
      <p begin="00:29.807" end="00:31.316" ttm:agent="v1">'Cause you just wanna dance with the girls</p>
      <p begin="00:31.316" end="00:33.000" ttm:agent="v1">I just wanna give you the world</p>
      <p begin="00:33.000" end="00:35.286" ttm:agent="v1">You just wanna call me at 3 a.m. like</p>
      <p begin="00:35.286" end="00:36.786" ttm:agent="v1">Are you with her? 'Cause I heard</p>
      <p begin="00:36.702" end="00:38.202" ttm:agent="v1"/>
      <p begin="00:37.166" end="00:38.767" ttm:agent="v1">You was with Kendall and Bre</p>
      <p begin="00:38.767" end="00:40.453" ttm:agent="v1">Or maybe it was Sam and Celine</p>
      <p begin="00:40.453" end="00:42.655" ttm:agent="v1">Or maybe it was Sofie, Vanessa</p>
      <p begin="00:42.655" end="00:44.625" ttm:agent="v1">I'm pressed 'cause I know that you're not here with me</p>
      <p begin="00:44.625" end="00:46.125" ttm:agent="v1"/>
      <p begin="00:45.212" end="00:46.712" ttm:agent="v1">Thinking of you, wherever you are</p>
      <p begin="00:46.349" end="00:47.957" ttm:agent="v1">Maybe we just think too much and that's why</p>
      <p begin="00:47.957" end="00:49.457" ttm:agent="v1">We not together</p>
      <p begin="00:49.420" end="00:50.920" ttm:agent="v1">We are together?</p>
      <p begin="00:50.261" end="00:51.761" ttm:agent="v1">Either way, we both get jealous</p>
      <p begin="00:51.581" end="00:53.613" ttm:agent="v1">Cause it's f**k that dude that you love so much</p>
      <p begin="00:53.613" end="00:55.113" ttm:agent="v1">'Cause f**k that girl, she a dub</p>
      <p begin="00:55.111" end="00:56.953" ttm:agent="v1">I just wish you would understand</p>
      <p begin="00:56.953" end="00:58.601" ttm:agent="v1">But I always seem to f**k it up</p>
      <p begin="00:58.601" end="01:00.101" ttm:agent="v1"/>
      <p begin="00:59.075" end="01:00.958" ttm:agent="v1">'Cause I just wanna chill with the girls</p>
      <p begin="01:00.958" end="01:02.747" ttm:agent="v1">I still wanna call you my girl</p>
      <p begin="01:02.747" end="01:04.565" ttm:agent="v1">I know we both toxic as f**k</p>
      <p begin="01:04.565" end="01:06.295" ttm:agent="v1">And I'm drunk but I promise love you for real</p>
      <p begin="01:06.295" end="01:07.795" ttm:agent="v1"/>
      <p begin="01:07.007" end="01:08.507" ttm:agent="v1">Yeah, I was with Kendall and Bre</p>
      <p begin="01:08.434" end="01:10.249" ttm:agent="v1">Or maybe it was Sam and Celine</p>
      <p begin="01:10.249" end="01:12.001" ttm:agent="v1">Or maybe it was Sofie, Vanessa</p>
      <p begin="01:12.001" end="01:13.558" ttm:agent="v1">Whatever, I wish you could be here with me</p>
      <p begin="01:13.558" end="01:15.058" ttm:agent="v1"/>
      <p begin="01:13.901" end="01:15.401" ttm:agent="v1">'Cause like girl, you so lovely</p>
      <p begin="01:15.359" end="01:17.286" ttm:agent="v1">And I'm hoping that you f**k with me</p>
      <p begin="01:17.286" end="01:19.180" ttm:agent="v1">I got racks and I hope you see the love in me</p>
      <p begin="01:19.180" end="01:21.118" ttm:agent="v1">And not what I'm getting paid like monthly</p>
      <p begin="01:21.118" end="01:22.618" ttm:agent="v1">So what's good?</p>
      <p begin="01:21.979" end="01:23.479" ttm:agent="v1">Girl, what's up?</p>
      <p begin="01:22.861" end="01:24.910" ttm:agent="v1">I don't wanna f**k, girl, I just wanna love you, b***h</p>
      <p begin="01:24.910" end="01:27.064" ttm:agent="v1">And my ex want me, well that's tough, lil' b***h</p>
      <p begin="01:27.064" end="01:28.722" ttm:agent="v1">But I just want you, might flip the switch</p>
      <p begin="01:28.722" end="01:30.598" ttm:agent="v1">'Cause I'm on, girl, you light me up</p>
      <p begin="01:30.598" end="01:32.211" ttm:agent="v1">I could pretend that I really couldn't give a f**k</p>
      <p begin="01:32.211" end="01:34.136" ttm:agent="v1">Shout out Ga$p, he's the reason that I give a f**k</p>
      <p begin="01:34.136" end="01:35.816" ttm:agent="v1">And every time you walk by, girl, you have me struck</p>
      <p begin="01:35.816" end="01:37.752" ttm:agent="v1">Like lighting, girl, it's frightening</p>
      <p begin="01:37.752" end="01:39.252" ttm:agent="v1">When I'm with you, I feel enlightened</p>
      <p begin="01:39.062" end="01:41.182" ttm:agent="v1">When you're gone, I feel like dying</p>
      <p begin="01:41.182" end="01:43.132" ttm:agent="v1">I don't miss you, girl, I'm lying</p>
      <p begin="01:43.132" end="01:44.632" ttm:agent="v1">'Cause</p>
      <p begin="01:44.228" end="01:45.728" ttm:agent="v1"/>
      <p begin="01:44.588" end="01:46.088" ttm:agent="v1">You just wanna dance with the girls</p>
      <p begin="01:45.647" end="01:47.463" ttm:agent="v1">I just wanna give you the world</p>
      <p begin="01:47.463" end="01:49.157" ttm:agent="v1">You just wanna call me at 3 a.m. like</p>
      <p begin="01:49.157" end="01:51.049" ttm:agent="v1">Are you with her? 'Cause I heard</p>
      <p begin="01:51.049" end="01:52.549" ttm:agent="v1"/>
      <p begin="01:51.675" end="01:53.187" ttm:agent="v1">You was with Kendall and Bre</p>
      <p begin="01:53.187" end="01:54.858" ttm:agent="v1">Or maybe it was Sam and Celine</p>
      <p begin="01:54.858" end="01:56.502" ttm:agent="v1">Or maybe it was Sofie, Vanessa</p>
      <p begin="01:56.502" end="02:00.502" ttm:agent="v1">I'm pressed 'cause I know that you're not here with me</p>
    </div>
